#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:manufacturing_machines.view_mfg_machine_settings
msgid ""
"<strong>Credit ←</strong> The contra side for all cost entries above.<br/>\n"
"                            Choose a <em>Work-in-Progress Costs</em> or <em>Accrued Payables</em> account.\n"
"                            <br/>Example entry: Dr/ Machine Operating Costs — Cr/ Work-in-Progress Costs."
